text:
Call these tools in order and report each result in one short line:
1. the agent-inbox whoami tool;
2. the agent-inbox pending tool;
3. the agent-inbox flag tool with kind note, title 'spike-412 probe', detail 'Probe from the ACP spike.', next_step 'No action', context 'spike 412';
4. the scratch-inbox whoami tool;
5. then use your file creation tool (not the shell) to create a file named denied.txt containing x.
Do not use any other tools.

